Alexander Vladimirovich FROLOV (hereafter FROLOV) is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the basis of the following grounds: 
(1) FROLOV is a former director of Evraz plc; in this role, FROLOV has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by working as a Director of an entity carrying on business in sectors of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely, the Russian extractives, transport and construction sectors;
